  "title": "S 50 (Freedom to Carry NC) (2025) — Permitless concealed handgun carry for US citizens 18+, with continued permit for reciprocity; plus line-of-duty death benefit, scholarship, firearm-assault and felon-firearm offenses",
  "urls": [
